// create a PaymentIntent using saved PaymentMethod (off-session)
const paymentIntent = await stripe.paymentIntents.create({
  amount: 2000,
  currency: 'usd',
  customer: 'cus_...',
  payment_method: 'pm_...',    // from setupIntent.payment_method
  off_session: true,
  confirm: true
});
```

Notes
- Create the SetupIntent with a customer so Stripe will attach the resulting PaymentMethod to that customer automatically.
- Use stripe.confirmCardSetup on the client to complete card collection without charging now.
- After success, use the saved PaymentMethod id to create PaymentIntents/charges later (typically off_session).

